@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Product Purchase API Permissioning
	Testing Koroneiki Product Purchase API Permissioning functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the product purchases on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the following products
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	* I tear down the product purchases on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Engineering" for the following products
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	* I tear down the products on koroneiki with the following names
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Automotive |

Scenario: Create product purchase attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki product purchases that are attempted to be created via API by non permissioned users should not be created.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Industry              | Automotive                               |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Notes                 | Additional account notes                 |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Sold By               | Liferay US                               |
	| Status                | Approved                                 |
	| Tier                  | Regular                                  |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              |
	And I create a product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I attempt to create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values as a non permissioned user
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}   |                |
	| Perpetual               | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                  |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate} |                |
	Then I should not be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"

Scenario: View product purchase attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki product purchases should not be viewable by non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Industry              | Automotive                               |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Notes                 | Additional account notes                 |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Sold By               | Liferay US                               |
	| Status                | Approved                                 |
	| Tier                  | Regular                                  |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              |
	And I create a product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}   |                |
	| Perpetual               | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                  |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate} |                |
	Then I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| Perpetual               | true            |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2 | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3 | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1               |                |
	And I should not be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Update product purchase attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki product purchases should not be able to be updated by non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Industry              | Automotive                               |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Notes                 | Additional account notes                 |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Sold By               | Liferay US                               |
	| Status                | Approved                                 |
	| Tier                  | Regular                                  |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              |
	And I create a product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}   |                |
	| Perpetual               | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                  |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate} |                |
	And I attempt to update a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" to have the following values as a non permissioned user
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}   |                |
	| Perpetual               | false              |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp4    | propertyValue4 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp5    | propertyValue5 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp6    | propertyValue6 |
	| Quantity                | 1                  |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate} |                |
	Then I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| Perpetual               | true            |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2 | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3 | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1               |                |
	And I should not be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" as a non permissioned user

